                <pb facs="0880" n="768" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg768"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 7370/32.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Norwegian Chargé to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Norwegian Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">White Sulphur
                                Springs, W. Va.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1910-07-01"><hi rendition="#italic">July 1,
                        1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>It is my sad duty to announce the death of Honorable O. Gude, minister for
                    Norway, to-night at 10 o’clock.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Morgenstierne.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
